  "text": "ECT Oncology Treatment | Veterinary Services | Southwater Veterinary\nSkip to content\nCall:\n01952 309306\nOut of Hours:\n01952 324381\nReferrals:\n01952 309307\nToggle menu\nPrimary veterinary care\nNurse clinics\nVaccinations\nLife stage veterinary care\nNeutering\nLaparoscopic surgery\nSouthwater saver club\nOrthopaedic and soft tissue surgery\nAdvanced medicine services\nAbout\nPricing Page Independent Vets\nPet repeat prescription request\nI’m being referred from another practice\nCT scans\nECT oncology treatment\nLaparoscopy\nSoft tissue surgery\nOrthopaedics\nBronchoscopy\nGastroscopy\nRhinoscopy\nOncology\nCystoscopy\nPricing Page\nRefer a pet\nReferring Veterinary Professionals\nCystoscopy\nRhinoscopy\nGastroscopy\nBronchoscopy\nLaparoscopy\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nOrthopaedics\nOncology\nCT Scans\nArthroscopy\nPricing Page\nReferring a client\nBook an appointment\nCall out of hours\nPrimary veterinary care\nNurse clinics\nVaccinations\nLife stage veterinary care\nNeutering\nLaparoscopic surgery\nSouthwater saver club\nOrthopaedic and soft tissue surgery\nAdvanced medicine services\nAbout\nPricing Page Independent Vets\nPet repeat prescription request\nI’m being referred from another practice\nCT scans\nECT oncology treatment\nLaparoscopy\nSoft tissue surgery\nOrthopaedics\nBronchoscopy\nGastroscopy\nRhinoscopy\nOncology\nCystoscopy\nPricing Page\nRefer a pet\nReferring Veterinary Professionals\nCystoscopy\nRhinoscopy\nGastroscopy\nBronchoscopy\nLaparoscopy\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nOrthopaedics\nOncology\nCT Scans\nArthroscopy\nPricing Page\nReferring a client\nECT oncology treatment\nHome\n|\nService\n|\nECT oncology treatment\nOncology Service\nHere at Southwater Veterinary Group, we offer a comprehensive oncology service for dogs and cats.\nWe provide affordable oncology care aimed at supporting veterinary colleagues in the diagnosis and management of neoplastic diseases.\nWith us you would get:\nFull case feedback and continued communication\nFlexible referral options (from diagnosis only to full case management)\nTransparent pricing\nCollaborative client communication\nDiagnosis and staging:\nLymph-node mapping\nContrast enhanced CT imaging for staging\nMinimally invasive biopsy, rhinoscopy and endoscopy\nSurgical oncology:\nExcision of benign and malignant neoplasia with advanced reconstruction\nAdvanced cavity (thoracic and abdominal) surgery\nRevision surgery for incomplete margins\nMarginal excision for palliation where appropriate\nMedical oncology:\nChemotherapy protocols tailored to individual patient needs and tolerance\nTargeted molecular treatment for suitable tumour types\nIntra-tumoral treatment for non-metastatic mast cell tumours\nMetronomic chemotherapy\nSupportive therapies to maintain and improve quality of life\nElectrochemotherapy (ECT):\nLocalised ECT for suitable tumour types\nAdjuvant treatment in incompletely removed tumours\nPalliative oncology:\nComprehensive pain management in osteosarcoma\nTumour debulking where appropriate for symptomatic relief\nClient support and education managed collaboratively\nCystoscopy\nView Service\nOncology\nView Service\nRhinoscopy\nView Service\nGastroscopy\nView Service\nBronchoscopy\nView Service\nOrthopaedics\nView Service\nRelated news stories\nAll related news\nDon’t forget to follow us\n@southwatervets\nWright House,\nStafford Park 1,\nTelford, TF3 3BD\nMain Line: 01952 309 306\nReferrals: 01952 309 307\ninfo@southwatervets.co.uk\nreferrals@southwatervets.co.uk\nOpening hours:\n8:30-6:30 Monday-Friday\n8:30-12:30 Saturday\nConsulting times:\n8:30-6:00 Monday-Friday\n8:30-12:00 Saturday\nOut of hours: 24/7 365 days a year\nCall: 01952 324381\nIndependent Care\nPet repeat prescription request\nNurse clinics\nVaccinations\nLife stage veterinary care\nNeutering\nLaparoscopic surgery\nOrthopaedic and soft tissue surgery\nAdvanced medicine services\nSouthwater saver club\nPrices\nAbout\nNews\nContact\nReferred from another practice\nRefer a pet\nCT scans\nECT oncology treatment\nLaparoscopy\nSoft tissue surgery\nOrthopaedics\nBronchoscopy\nGastroscopy\nRhinoscopy\nOncology\nCystoscopy\nPrices\nVeterinary Professionals\nReferring a client\nCystoscopy\nRhinoscopy\nGastroscopy\nBronchoscopy\nLaparoscopy\nCT Scans\nSoft tissue surgery\nOrthopaedics\nOncology\nArthroscopy\nUnderstanding veterinary surgical qualifications\nPrices\nWright House,\nStafford Park 1,\nTelford, TF3 3BD\ninfo@southwatervets.co.uk\nreferrals@southwatervets.co.uk\nMain Line: 01952 309 306\nReferrals: 01952 309 307\nOpening hours:\n8:30-6:30 Monday-Friday\n8:30-12:30 Saturday\nConsulting times:\n8:30-6:00 Monday-Friday\n8:30-12:00 Saturday\nOut of hours: 24/7 365 days a year\n01952 324381\nCookie Policy\nPrivacy Policy\n© 2026 Southwater vets All rights reserved\nwebsite by\n© 2026 Southwater Veterinary Group  All rights reserved\nCookie Policy\nPrivacy Policy\nwebsite by\ntest",
